@startuml
title 图 RA-01c 核心业务类图（三）· 笔记、导出与治理
hide empty members
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei

class "User" as User <<引用>> {
}
class "Answer" as Answer <<引用>> {
}
class "ContentBlock" as ContentBlock <<引用>> {
}
class "Citation" as Citation <<引用>> {
}
class "DocumentVersion" as DocumentVersion <<引用>> {
}
class "ParseRun" as ParseRun <<引用>> {
}
class "Note" as Note {
  + note_id
  + type
  + body
  + tags
  --
  + create(anchor)
  + bindVersion(v)
  + markStale()
}
class "ExportJob" as ExportJob {
  + job_id
  + format
  + scope
  + target_path
  + status
  + error
  --
  + create()
  + write()
  + verifySource()
}
class "Notification" as Notification {
  + notification_id
  + type
  + resource_ref
  + created_at
  + read
  --
  + notify()
  + markRead()
  + dedupeKey()
}
class "AuditEvent" as AuditEvent {
  + event_id
  + event_type
  + actor
  + resource_ref
  + occurred_at
  --
  + record()
  + appendOnly()
}

User "1" -- "0..*" Note : 创建
Note "0..*" --> "0..1" ContentBlock : 锚点
Note "0..*" --> "0..1" Answer : 来源
Note "0..*" --> "1" DocumentVersion : 绑定版本
User "1" -- "0..*" ExportJob : 发起
ExportJob "0..*" --> "0..*" Note : 导出
ExportJob "1" --> "0..*" Citation : 引用
User "1" -- "0..*" Notification : 接收
Notification "0..*" --> "0..1" Answer : 提醒
Notification "0..*" --> "0..1" ParseRun : 处理状态
User "1" -- "0..*" AuditEvent : 触发
AuditEvent "0..*" --> "0..1" Answer : 留痕
AuditEvent "0..*" --> "0..1" ExportJob : 留痕
@enduml
